The [Dartington Recreation Association](/about) warmly invites all members, supporters and members of the public to our upcoming **Annual General Meeting (AGM)**.

The AGM is an important opportunity to reflect on our achievements over the past year, review our financial health, elect our Board of Trustees and look ahead to our future plans.

## Meeting agenda

1. Welcome and apologies
2. Minutes of the previous AGM - review and approval
3. Trustees' Annual Report: a review of the DRA's activities and impact over the last year, and acceptance of the Independent Examiner's Report for the financial year ending 31st March 2026
4. Election and re-election of Trustees
5. AOB

---

The meeting takes place **upstairs in the Meadowbrook Community Centre**. Interested in standing as a trustee? Find out more about [being a trustee](/content/be-a-trustee).
